{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果公司與美國司法部及多個州的原告10月21日向新澤西聯邦法院提交聯合通知，表示雙方無法就蘋果應繼續提交多長時間範圍內的內部文件達成一致。司法部要求蘋果更新文件資料，覆蓋所有相關人員及其他來源，直到事實調查結束前30天；目前事實調查期限已延至2027年5月下旬。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583284.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:42.036289+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T04:45:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_hash":"913ba1ae2e48fd7553b80ee21831073d56557e0648cb392b7e847db419df7880","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}